{
  "key": 18239,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_PeopleHereWereRobbed",
      "en_US": [
        "The people here were robbed.\r",
        "It’s obvious that Team Rocket is\n",
        "behind this most heinous crime!\r",
        "Even our Police Force has\n",
        "trouble with the Rockets!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_GruntIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey! Stay out!\n",
        "It’s not your yard!\r",
        "…Huh?\n",
        "Me?\r",
        "I’m an innocent bystander!\n",
        "Don’t you believe me?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_IfSlowbroWasntThereCouldCutTree",
      "en_US": [
        "If that Slowbro wasn’t there, you\n",
        "could Cut down the small tree.\r",
        "That way, you could get to the\n",
        "other side.\r",
        "I think there’s a way around it,\n",
        "though."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_PokemonEncyclopediaAmusing",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re making an encyclopedia on\n",
        "Pokémon? That sounds amusing."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_TrainerLifeIsToughIsntIt",
      "en_US": [
        "You’re a Trainer, too?\r",
        "Collecting, battling…\n",
        "It’s a tough life, isn’t it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_ThisIsCeruleanCave",
      "en_US": [
        "This is Cerulean Cave.\r",
        "Horribly strong Pokémon live inside\n",
        "there.\r",
        "It takes a very special Trainer to\n",
        "be allowed inside there.\r",
        "You’d have to be strong enough to\n",
        "become the Pokémon League\f",
        "Champion for starters.\r",
        "And, you would have to have\n",
        "made a great achievement."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_CitySign",
      "en_US": [
        "Cerulean City\n",
        "A Mysterious, Blue Aura Surrounds\f",
        "It"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_GymSign",
      "en_US": [
        "Cerulean City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Misty\f",
        "The Tomboyish Mermaid!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_BikeShop_Text_ShinyNewBicycle",
      "en_US": "A shiny new Bicycle!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_OkayIllReturnStolenTM",
      "en_US": [
        "…Okay.\n",
        "I’ll return the TM I stole."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_RecoveredTM28FromGrunt",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} recovered TM28 from\n",
        "the Team Rocket Grunt."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_BetterGetMovingBye",
      "en_US": [
        "I better get moving!\n",
        "Bye!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_YouCanCutDownSmallTrees",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you know that you can Cut down\n",
        "small trees?\r",
        "Even that small tree in front of\n",
        "the shop can be Cut down.\r",
        "I think there’s a way around it,\n",
        "though."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_RivalIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Yo! {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "You’re still struggling along back\n",
        "here?\r",
        "I’m doing great! I caught a bunch\n",
        "of strong and smart Pokémon!\r",
        "Here, let me see what you caught,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_RivalPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}: Hey, guess what?\r",
        "Brock let me run his Gym for a day.\n",
        "I crushed every challenger!\r",
        "That’s one approval for me.\n",
        "The Pallet Gym is as good as mine!\r",
        "Oh, and another thing.\r",
        "I went to Bill’s and got him to\n",
        "show me his rare Pokémon.\r",
        "That added a lot of pages to my\n",
        "Pokédex!\r",
        "After all, Bill’s world famous as a\n",
        "PokéMANIAC.\r",
        "He invented the Pokémon Storage\n",
        "System on PC, too.\r",
        "Since you’re using his system,\n",
        "you should go thank him.\r",
        "Well, I better get rolling!\n",
        "Smell ya later!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_OhRightLittlePresentAsFavor",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, yeah, right.\r",
        "I feel sorry for you. No, really.\n",
        "You’re always plodding behind me.\r",
        "So here, I’ll give you a little\n",
        "present as a favor."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_ExplainFameCheckerSmellYa",
      "en_US": [
        "A chatty gossip like you…\n",
        "That thing’s perfect.\r",
        "I don’t need it because I don’t\n",
        "give a hoot about others.\r",
        "All right, this time I really am\n",
        "gone. Smell ya!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_CeruleanCity_Text_MakeRoomForThisCantRun",
      "en_US": [
        "Make room for this!\n",
        "I can’t run until I give it to you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_TypeTutor_Text_WhichMove",
      "en_US": "Which move should I teach?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_TypeTutor_Text_WhichMon",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Pokémon should learn\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_TypeTutor_Text_Taught",
      "en_US": "Well done! Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_TypeTutor_Text_Bye",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back any time. A Leader\n",
        "never stops learning."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0467_T04_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
